Hi all,

cpufrequtils-0.1-pre2 is out and available at

http://www.brodo.de/cpufreq/cpufrequtils-0.1-pre2.tar.bz2 (~380KB)

Changes since -pre1 include i18n support (current languages: "de" and "en")
and increased portability due to a patch by Mattia Dongili which added
proper detection for NR_CPUS.

Thanks for all the feedback and test reports I've received so far!

